# openHC — Control4 EA3 (rev 2). No radio (wired-only, e1000), a BCM53125 switch
# on SPI via DSA, and the ADAU1451 DSP analog audio (ohc.features: switch
# audio-dsp). The ext4 eMMC rootfs comes from the shared 'emmc' feature.
#
# PROVEN on hardware: secure-boot fuse is BLOWN, so the eMMC path rejects an
# unsigned kernel — openHC takes over via the CEFDK `script`+`bootlinux`
# autoscript (our kernel in the raw eMMC gap; signed stock kernel left as the
# `script off` recovery). See /ea/ea3/ and tools/ohc-ea-takeover.py.
BR2_TARGET_GENERIC_HOSTNAME="openhc-ea3"
BR2_TARGET_GENERIC_ISSUE="openHC EA3"
